{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "agg_true-qrec-mse", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "1-2_4", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Certainly. Here are some practical steps tailored to help you develop a healthier, more active lifestyle:\n\n1. **Modify Eating Habits Gradually:** Start by replacing late-night or restaurant meals with simple, balanced home-cooked dinners. Gradually shift your dinner time earlier by 15\u201330 minutes each week.\n\n2. **Incorporate Movement into Your Routine:** Since you\u2019ve stopped exercising recently, try adding short, enjoyable activities\u2014like a brisk 10-minute walk after dinner or stretching breaks while using your phone.\n\n3. **Limit Screen Time:** Allocate specific periods for phone use and set reminders to take activity breaks. For example, stand up or walk around every 30 minutes.\n\n4. **Set Manageable Goals:** Use a step counter or fitness app to track daily movement. Start with small goals, such as 5,000 steps per day, and increase gradually.\n\n5. **Make Activity Social:** Invite friends for active outings instead of eating out\u2014such as a walk in the park or a casual sports game.\n\n6. **Monitor Progress:** Keep a simple journal or use an app to log changes in your habits and how you feel. Celebrate small successes to stay motivated.\n\nRemember, consistent small changes are more effective and sustainable than drastic shifts.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0039-29-15173:10": 28.27473258972168, "clueweb22-en0040-05-12066:1": 27.77680206298828, "clueweb22-en0040-83-10465:12": 27.350772857666016, "clueweb22-en0001-07-05882:17": 27.246423721313477, "clueweb22-en0024-39-07318:25": 26.79829978942871, "clueweb22-en0000-46-04539:12": 26.427995681762695, "clueweb22-en0004-86-05045:1": 26.17277717590332, "clueweb22-en0013-61-07254:1": 26.00349235534668, "clueweb22-en0033-31-14899:11": 25.962297439575195, "clueweb22-en0018-75-09847:8": 25.646869659423828}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I eat dinner late at night.",