{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "agg_true-qrec-mse", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "3-2_6", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Combining yoga with swimming is an excellent approach for both recovery and overall well-being. In London, there are several accessible swimming spots you might enjoy. Many local leisure centres offer indoor pools suitable for lap swimming and gentle exercise, which could be ideal during recovery and variable weather. If you are interested in outdoor swimming, places like Hampstead Heath Ponds or the Serpentine Lido in Hyde Park provide unique swimming experiences in natural settings. Both locations are relatively central and well-regarded for their facilities.\n\nYou may also want to check if your local leisure centre offers aqua yoga or gentle water-based fitness classes, as these can be a great way to blend both activities. Starting with a few gentle sessions and ensuring your finger is protected\u2014perhaps with a waterproof bandage or swim glove\u2014will help you make the most of your recovery while staying active.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0001-77-03399:4": 18.803604125976562, "clueweb22-en0001-34-06677:6": 18.675312042236328, "clueweb22-en0002-12-02921:14": 18.315563201904297, "clueweb22-en0001-51-00388:5": 17.9185733795166, "clueweb22-en0028-05-13680:11": 17.6457462310791, "clueweb22-en0033-88-04990:8": 17.61837387084961, "clueweb22-en0002-12-02921:13": 17.4832763671875, "clueweb22-en0028-05-13680:12": 17.412029266357422, "clueweb22-en0030-69-08396:10": 17.33540153503418, "clueweb22-en0011-51-02399:15": 17.127582550048828}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I live in London, but my family is from Manchester.", "I have recently moved to a new flat with a small garden."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0001-77-03399:4": 18.803604125976562, "clueweb22-en0001-34-06677:6": 18.675312042236328, "clueweb22-en0002-12-02921:14": 18.315563201904297, "clueweb22-en0001-51-00388:5": 17.9185733795166, "clueweb22-en0028-05-13680:11": 17