{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "agg_true-qrec-mse", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_4", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "CO2 laser treatment works by delivering precise beams of carbon dioxide laser energy to the skin, targeting the top layers of damaged or uneven skin. This process removes the outermost layer and heats the underlying tissue, which stimulates collagen production. As your skin heals, new, smoother, and more evenly toned skin replaces the old surface. \n\nThis treatment is effective for concerns like dark spots, uneven tone, visible pores, and signs of aging. Results typically include a reduction in pigmentation, smoother texture, and firmer skin. While CO2 laser is quite powerful and offers long-lasting improvements, it is considered an aggressive procedure and may require several days to a couple of weeks for recovery.\n\nA personalized consultation with a specialist is essential to assess your skin type and goals, ensuring the treatment is safe and suitable for your needs\u2014especially since there are tailored options for different skin types and concerns.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0025-27-07287:4": 15.320806503295898, "clueweb22-en0021-25-02933:1": 15.09407901763916, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:2": 14.791197776794434, "clueweb22-en0025-02-00163:1": 14.541458129882812, "clueweb22-en0005-61-18009:21": 14.354840278625488, "clueweb22-en0042-23-17544:6": 14.332048416137695, "clueweb22-en0004-01-09924:8": 14.060611724853516, "clueweb22-en0020-47-00301:3": 14.040607452392578, "clueweb22-en0004-26-14207:15": 13.97743034362793, "clueweb22-en0035-67-12299:4": 13.950491905212402}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I've noticed dark spots and uneven tone on my face.", "I have visible pores on my cheeks and nose.", "I usually wear makeup to even out my complexion.", "I am a 40-year-old woman.", "I'm interested in treatments that improve my skin with minimal downtime.", "I don't sleep as well as I used to, and it shows on my face."]}], "refer