{"metadata": {"team_id": "guidance", "run_id": "agg_true-qrec-mse", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "8-1_5", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Certainly. The idea is to use short, timed work sessions to help you focus on one task at a time without feeling pressured to complete it all at once. Here\u2019s how you can implement this technique in your office:\n\n1. **Choose Two Tasks:** Select two tasks you need to work on.\n2. **Set a Timer:** Use a timer (on your phone, computer, or a dedicated app) for a short, manageable interval\u2014such as 15 or 25 minutes.\n3. **Focus on One Task:** Work only on the first task until the timer rings. Don\u2019t worry about finishing it; the goal is just to make progress.\n4. **Switch or Break:** When the timer goes off, either take a short break or switch to the second task and repeat the process.\n5. **Alternate & Repeat:** Continue alternating between the two tasks, always using the timer to define your focus periods.\n\nThis approach helps prevent hyperfocus on one thing and reduces the urge to multitask. Using visual timers or reminder apps can further support your focus and help you track your progress throughout the day.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0036-02-14625:2": 23.15325927734375, "clueweb22-en0038-91-03346:1": 22.999340057373047, "clueweb22-en0034-01-04061:2": 22.5429744720459, "clueweb22-en0030-53-01118:10": 22.352933883666992, "clueweb22-en0013-60-10409:7": 22.223251342773438, "clueweb22-en0038-68-03500:5": 21.565444946289062, "clueweb22-en0030-53-01118:9": 21.346435546875, "clueweb22-en0036-02-14625:3": 21.254146575927734, "clueweb22-en0026-62-07087:15": 21.136812210083008, "clueweb22-en0026-62-07087:13": 20.811397552490234}, "ptkb_provenance": ["I work in an office."]}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0036-02-14625:2": 23.15325927734375, "clueweb22-en0038-91-03346:1": 22.999340057373047, "clueweb22-en0034-01-04061:2": 22.5429744720459, "clueweb22-en0030-53-01118:10": 22.352933883666992, "clueweb22-en0013-60-10